  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-08-15</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">辦公室應用</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">developer-roadmap</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 364,457</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供了互動式的開發者職涯路線圖、指南及其他教育內容，旨在協助開發者規劃並成長其職業生涯。對於希望明確學習路徑和提升專業技能的開發者而言，這是一個寶貴的職涯規劃資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/nilbuild/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">寫程式</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">public-apis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 459,446</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供了一個免費 APIs 的綜合列表，讓開發者能快速找到並整合各種服務。對於需要探索不同 API 資源的程式設計師來說，這是一個寶貴的學習與開發工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">freeCodeCamp</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 454,043</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">freeCodeCamp 是一個提供免費程式設計、數學和電腦科學課程的開源平台。它透過實作專案和互動式課程，幫助初學者和經驗豐富的開發者提升技能。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">free-programming-books</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 394,439</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">匯集了大量免費的程式設計書籍，涵蓋各種程式語言與技術。對於想免費學習或深入研究特定程式領域的開發者來說，這是一個極佳的資源庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-python</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 314,085</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">彙整了一系列精選的 Python 框架、函式庫、工具和資源。對於 Python 開發者而言，這是一個快速尋找實用工具和學習資源的絕佳起點。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vinta/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-selfhosted</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 312,812</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">收集了一系列可以自行架設（self-hosted）的免費軟體網路服務和網路應用程式。它為追求資料自主權、隱私或希望建立客製化服務的技術愛好者和小型團隊提供了豐富的選擇。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">project-based-learning</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 279,285</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">整理了精選的專案導向教學清單，鼓勵學習者透過實際動手做來掌握技能。這對於希望將理論知識應用於實踐、快速提升開發能力的學生和開發者來說，是一個非常有效的學習方式。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/practical-tutorials/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">react</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 247,248</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">React 是一個用於建構網頁和原生使用者介面的函式庫，以其聲明式編程和元件化架構廣受開發者歡迎。它簡化了複雜 UI 的開發過程，是現代前端開發不可或缺的工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/react/react\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/react\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">skitter-creek-bath-salts</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C | Star: 1,640</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">透過記憶體擾亂技術（DRAM scrambling），skitter-creek-bath-salts 旨在探索解鎖 CPU 潛在能力的方法。這是一個低層級系統程式設計和資安研究專案，值得關注其在硬體層面探索的可能性。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/xoreaxeaxeax/skitter-creek-bath-salts\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/skitter-creek-bath-salts\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">paper</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 1,517</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Paper 專注於提出一種用於時空可組合性（Spatiotemporal Composability）的程式設計典範。它旨在解決複雜系統中的時間與空間關係問題，為開發者提供了新的思維框架和工具來建構更具彈性的應用。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/cordiverse/paper\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/paper\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Skill</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">watermarks-remover</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 9,264</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">watermarks-remover 是一個用於移除多種 AI 來源標記的工具，能夠處理各種文件和圖片格式的浮水印與中繼資料。它提供內容淨化功能，對於處理 AI 生成內容的隱私和版權問題具有實用價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/watermarks-remover\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">h3.c</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C | Star: 1,881</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">h3.c 是一個專為 Mac 電腦設計的 MiniMax H3 推理引擎。它提供高效能的 AI 推理能力，對於在 macOS 環境下開發或執行機器學習應用的開發者來說，是一個重要的底層工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/antirez/h3.c\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/h3.c\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Agent</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">openclaw</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 386,358</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">OpenClaw 是一個跨平台、跨作業系統的個人 AI 助手，旨在提供用戶個人化的智慧協助。它以「龍蝦方式」運作，強調其獨特且廣泛的應用能力，值得關注其自主性與便捷性。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">superpowers</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 272,363</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Superpowers 是一個強調「代理能力」（agentic skills）的框架和軟體開發方法論。它旨在為開發具備自主性和多步驟決策能力的 AI 代理提供結構與指引，是 AI Agent 領域值得關注的創新方向。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">deepseek-harness</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 109,409</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">DeepSeek Harness 是一個以「萬物皆插件」為核心理念的框架。它提供了一個高度模組化的環境，讓使用者能夠透過豐富的插件擴展 AI 能力與工作流程，是構建客製化 AI 解決方案的強大平台。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/deepseek-harness\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">deepseek-harness-desktop</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 4,659</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是為 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 生態系統量身打造的現代化桌面端應用程式。它旨在提供更流暢、直觀的使用者體驗，讓用戶能更便捷地管理和操作 DeepSeek Harness 的各項功能。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/anywhere-labs/deepseek-harness-desktop\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/deepseek-harness-desktop\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-dsh-plugin</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 2,507</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 插件的精選列表，收集了多樣化的功能擴充。對於 DeepSeek Harness 的使用者而言，這個清單是尋找並整合新功能、提升 AI 助手能力的寶貴資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/awesome-dsh-plugin\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-web-ui</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 2,481</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案為 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI 提供了豐富的插件和主題，涵蓋任務板、Git 圖形、遠端行動介面等。它旨在提升使用者介面的功能性和客製化程度，讓 DeepSeek Harness 的體驗更加個人化。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-web-ui\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-anchored-standard</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 1,828</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">dsh-anchored-standard 是一個為 DeepSeek Harness 設計的雙階段預設配置。它提供一個最小化對齊的啟動階段，隨後載入完整標準工具，有助於簡化 DeepSeek Harness 的部署與客製化流程。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-anchored-standard\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">WeChat-AI</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,730</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">WeChat-AI 是一個將 AI 能力整合到微信平台上的專案。它可能提供智慧對話、自動回覆或資訊查詢等功能，旨在提升微信使用者的互動體驗。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/SMNETSTUDIO/WeChat-AI\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/WeChat-AI\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            </div>"
}